{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff597fa9-72fe-8048-bb74-1e6868027d6b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T09:57:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sofia Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes, good morning. My name is Sofia Raposo. I am calling because my trash, it was not picked up again, and I want to know the new schedule after the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:52:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Let me get some notes down here. Raposo, R-A-P-O-S-O, right? And where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:53:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. I am at 363 Old Beach Road, near Easton's Beach. The bins, they sit outside since, [line breaks up] since Monday, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out a little there. Since Monday, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:53:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, since Monday. Can you hear me now? The signal here is not good, I am in the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got you now. So, 363 Old Beach Road, trash not picked up since Monday. Is that the regular trash or the recycling too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:53:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the trash. The recycling, they took it. But the trash, no. And I put it out the night before, like the paper says. I did everything right and still, nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:53:55-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's annoying. Holiday weeks throw everything off. Usually after a holiday, pickup slides a day behind for the rest of that week, and then it goes back to normal the following week. What day is your regular pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday is my day. So Monday, they were supposed to come. Then I thought, okay, the holiday, maybe Tuesday. Then Wednesday. Now it is Thursday and the bin is still full, [inaudible] and the smell, it is not nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:54:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, got it. Monday route, so I'd have expected you to be picked up by now. Let me check the sheet. [pause] Okay, I'm seeing the routes got pushed around a bit. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. So the new schedule has your Monday route going back to its normal Monday this coming week, the nineteenth. Whether yours was actually missed this week, I can't tell from this screen. I'll put in a missed pickup for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:11-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The nineteenth, okay. But what do I do with this trash until then? I cannot keep it. I am trying to make one rotisserie chicken last for three dinners, so every little bit of food I have, I am careful, and now the bin is full of other things and the smell is coming in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'd leave the bin at the curb so the crew sees it, and I'll flag it as a missed pickup at that address so they can swing by. I can't promise the exact hour, but it goes on the list for today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today or tomorrow. Hm. This is not the first time, Kevin. I want that a supervisor calls me back. I want somebody to explain to me why my street is forgotten."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's fair. I'll note you want a supervisor to call you back. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0196. Please, you can repeat it for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0196. That right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is it. And the best time is, um, [line breaks up] in the afternoon, after one o'clock. In the morning I am at work, and the signal there is worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After one, got it. I've got Sofia Raposo, 363 Old Beach Road, missed trash pickup, Monday route, wants the new schedule, and a supervisor callback after one. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, only that. Just, please, that somebody comes. I do not want to call a third time next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:57:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll make sure the note says that. You should hear from somebody today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Sofia. Take care."
    }
  ],
